cal royalty. All the way from the mighty Pacific Northwest\, The Young Fres
 
h Fellows return to The Bowery. Frontman Scott McCaughey has maintained a h
 
ectic schedule with the likes of The Minus 5\, Baseball Project and his sol
 
o career but he is taking this very fab four back on the road to play tunes
 
 from the recent release "Loft" (Yep Roc) as well as much loved YFF classic
 
s from over forty years in the business with his bandmates Kurt Bloch\, Jim
 
 Sangster and John Perrin. Te Vista are New Jersey's greatest pop band sinc
 
e The Critters so we highly recommend you arrive early. WFMU's notorious To
 
dd-O-Phonic Todd will provide extra value by playing records this evening. 
 
