SUMMARY:Kit Kin | Jennifer McNamara Quintet | Lieff
LOCATION:Berlin\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:An evening of distinct sounds at Berlin\, featuring the Jennife
 
r McNamara Quintet\, Kit Kin\, and Lieff Kaplan. Jennifer McNamara brings t
 
ogether straight-ahead jazz with the energy and experimentation of New York
 
's punk and avant-garde scenes. Kit Kin pairs haunting vocals with mournful
 
 melodies and atmospheric arrangements that move between beauty and unease.
 
 Lieff Kaplan blends funk\, jazz\, and soul through a style shaped by groov
 
e\, improvisation\, and a wide range of musical influences. Three unique ar
 
tists come together for one intimate and surreal night of music. Tickets & 
 
info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/kit-kin-jennifer-mcnamara-berlin-tick
 
ets/14340844
