BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261016-591@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261014T195024Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T120000
SUMMARY:Shaping LGBTQ+ History: A Family Tour and Workshop
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>Green-Wood has partnered with History UnErased to bring fami
 
lies together to learn about LGBTQ+ historical figures memorialized at Gree
 
n-Wood\, then create their own clay art inspired by them. Together we\\'ll 
 
introduce families to queer representation in history and the arts\, model 
 
age-appropriate Tickets & info: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/shaping-lgbtq-
 
history-a-family-tour-and-workshop-tickets-1995688856091
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/shaping-lgbtq-history-a-family-tour-and-wo
 
rkshop-tickets-1995688856091
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261016-592@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261014T195024Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T150000
SUMMARY:Discover Green-Wood Trolley Tour
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>Hop on board our cozy\, warm trolley for an expert-led tour 
 
of Green-Wood\\'s historic landscape and some of the Cemetery’s most intr
 
iguing permanent residents. Whether you\\'re a first-time visitor or a seas
 
oned explorer\, this is your chance to experience 478 acres of art\, histor
 
y\, and nature. Walk Tickets & info: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/discover-
 
green-wood-trolley-tour-tickets-1980161824321
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/discover-green-wood-trolley-tour-tickets-1
 
980161824321
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261016-593@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261014T195024Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T170000
SUMMARY:Secrets in Stone
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>The Victorians were masters of secrets\, and they took plent
 
y of them to the grave! Across Green-Wood\, every carved flower\, weathered
 
 angel\, and mysterious emblem tells a story. On this crowd- favorite walki
 
ng tour\, you’ll become a detective of the dead\, decoding an elaborate l
 
anguage of symbols p Tickets & info: https://www.green-wood.com/event/secre
 
ts-in-stone-13/2026-10-17/
URL:https://www.green-wood.com/event/secrets-in-stone-13/2026-10-17/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261016-594@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261014T195024Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T190000
SUMMARY:Green-Wood After Hours
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>The dead don\\'t keep visiting hours\, but we do! Join us af
 
ter dark for a walk through Green-Wood\\'s history\, legends\, and secrets.
 
 And before you depart\, step inside the Catacombs\, a space that is normal
 
ly locked to the public. </p>\\n Tickets & info: https://www.green-wood.com
 
/event/green-wood-after-hours-56/2026-10-17/1/
URL:https://www.green-wood.com/event/green-wood-after-hours-56/2026-10-17/1
 
/
END:VEVENT
