DESCRIPTION:Get out of the city and visit pottery studios throughout the Hu
 
dson Valley on our chartered bus tour. Join us for Saturday\, Sunday\, or b
 
oth days to meet the artists where they live and work\, shop for pots\, and
 
 enjoy a boxed lunch along the way. Register for Saturday\, October 17 Bus 
 
