SUMMARY:Stella
LOCATION:Museum of the Moving Image\, Astoria (Central)
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Michael Cacoyannis. 1955\, 93 mins. Greece. Digital. With 
 
Melina Merkouri\, Giorgos Foundas\, Alekos Alexandrakis\, Voula Zouboulaki\
 
